WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:38.750
Haman Karn met with Jamitov
despite collaborating with the A.E.U.G....

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:42.430
...in order to ensure the Zabi Family
would take over the Earth Sphere.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:47.070
During this operation,
Kamille captured Sarah...

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:50.170
...and returned to the Argama.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:55.120
Coming From the Heavens

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.280
<i>Roger!</i>

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.160
<i>All units may depart independently.</i>

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.290
You don't have enough supplies?!

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:12.300
You want to leave now,
don't you?

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.160
<i>I don't care about procedures!</i>

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.330
<i>Send out the ships that are ready!</i>

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.470
What's the latest with Axis?

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:20.870
Please take a look.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:24.940
We estimate it will be one hour
before it reaches the Gate of Zedan.

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:30.850
Is Haman serious about ramming Axis
into the Gate of Zedan?!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.350
We have been observing lights
emitted from Axis.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.220
They're ships.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.380
So they're ramming a vacated Axis.

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:43.220
If we also evacuated, we'd be even.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:45.760
What is it?

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:47.900
What?!

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:50.990
I see.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:54.970
Your Excellency, the A.E.U.G.'s fleet
is approaching this area.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:58.370
It's not like the A.E.U.G.'s
a bunch of idlers.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.910
It was to be expected.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.710
The main objective of this operation
is to keep the Titans' fleet...

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.550
...from fleeing the Gate of Zedan
before Axis hits it.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.260
So, like a game of whack-a-mole.

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:16.490
That's a clever way to put it.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.220
Thank you.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:19.500
You're late.

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:20.860
I can't find Katz.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.680
The A.E.U.G.'s arrived, as expected.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.780
Ensign Reccoa, I'll have you sortie.

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:40.810
It's going to be
a confusing battle...

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:44.980
...but I want you to rescue
Sarah in the midst of that confusion.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.250
Do you insist?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.150
I do.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.790
I want Sarah and the information
she's obtained.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.260
If it were you captured by the enemy...

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:59.130
...I'd order the same thing of Sarah.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:03.040
I am humbly pleased to hear that.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.810
The Palace Athene is ready for you.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.310
It's a fine machine.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:10.310
I shall do my best to live up to
your expectations.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.110
I know you can do it, Reccoa Londe.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.150
Yes, sir!

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:18.590
Send out the Palace Athene!
Following that, we will leave this area!

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:19.620
Yes, sir!

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.170
I thought you might be here!

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:35.100
Did you skip the meeting
to keep observing Sarah?!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.500
Lieutenant Emma is furious!

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.140
Katz! Come!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.010
- We're taking off!
- Let go!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:42.680
Kamille!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.850
Don't you realize what's going on around us?

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:47.850
And don't tell me
you can't do that!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.520
Are you telling me to fight
while feeling like this?!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.990
I'm sure you know how I feel,
Kamille!

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.190
Don't think about Sarah!

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:59.530
If you can't concentrate on the battle,
you're going to end up dead.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.270
I know that!

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.240
Katz!

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:06.800
I'll fight!

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.700
I'm a pilot, after all!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.720
We're within the main cannon's range.

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:23.120
We'll fire in this horizontal formation!
Prepare to fire main cannon!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.890
They've finally arrived.

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:41.200
The Dogosse Gier is ready to leave port.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.800
Please board.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.900
<i>All units, hurry!</i>
<i>Mobile suits, prepare to take off!</i>

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.810
<i>Katz, you'll never become</i>
<i>the pilot you wish to be...</i>

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.850
<i>...unless you overcome this hurdle.</i>

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.560
Argama, mobile suit team, taking off!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.030
<i>I pray for your success.</i>

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.930
Gundam Mk. II, ready for take-off!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:11.890
Rick Dias team, ready for take-off!

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.970
G-Defenser, taking off!

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.820
Zeta Gundam! Kamille! Let's do it!

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.790
<i>As long as we get out before Axis hits.</i>

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.330
All vessels! Ensure your
mobile suits have been boarded!

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.270
Get as many missiles as you can!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.960
<i>Load anything and everything you can!</i>

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.030
Attach it with cable!

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:48.330
As long as we get it into space!

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:49.810
Hurry!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.930
We'll leave the A.E.U.G.
to the fleet outside!

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:55.470
Docked vessels
need only think of departing!

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.220
Captain.

00:06:57.380 --> 00:07:00.150
The Cyber-Newtypes are requesting
to sortie.

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.140
Gates and Rosamia?

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.350
No. Have them standby.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:05.360
Yes, sir!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.390
Has he? Okay.

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:10.230
Captain, His Excellency has boarded.

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.700
Good! Launch the Dogosse Gier!

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:28.870
Ignore the transport ships!
Sink the battleships!

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:29.910
Roger!

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:39.310
Never mind the enemy mobile suits!
We'll block the spaceport exits!

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:40.730
Roger!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.550
- Let's start whacking moles!
- <i>Right!</i>

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.610
How are things going?!

00:07:57.210 --> 00:08:02.270
The fifth and sixth Gaza C squadron
have left for Gryps 2.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.410
Good. It's looking great.

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:09.590
It'll be interesting to observe how much
of their fleet will become space debris...

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.020
...along with the Gate of Zedan.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.980
It appears to have begun.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:42.580
Okay!

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:51.920
We'll have our mobile suits
handle the rear exits!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:54.400
Don't let a single vessel
depart from the front!

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.590
There's a mobile suit approaching us
from behind!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.600
- An enemy?!
- That's unconfirmed!

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.230
Shoot it down!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.000
Observation unit, where
were you looking?! It's coming!

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:11.640
I'm amazed how easily
they let me get behind them.

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:15.950
A direct hit there should do it...

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:24.100
What?!

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.350
What are you doing?! Stop it!

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.800
A direct hit?!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.650
That voice. Kamille?

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.500
Engine room! Report on damage!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.780
Rear gunners!
Get that mobile suit!

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:47.290
Captain!

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.510
The Methuss has arrived!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.750
Don't rely solely on the Methuss!

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.480
Back her up!

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:54.290
Seal the Gate of Zedan up completely!

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.660
How dare you try to destroy the Argama!

00:09:58.560 --> 00:09:59.530
Fa?!

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.370
He's strong!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.040
Damage doesn't seem to be serious.

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:21.520
And the enemy?!

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:25.190
Fa!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:41.430
<i>Katz.</i>

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:43.370
<i>I wanted to see you</i>
<i>one more time, but...!</i>

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:49.480
Sarah!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.850
Katz! Not that way!
You'll be hit by our own!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.350
Emma! Go after Katz!

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:58.660
Roger!

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:05.520
What speed!

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:10.090
Behind me?!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.730
You've improved a great deal, Fa.

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:17.040
Miss Reccoa...!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.050
Fa! Don't chase it too far!

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:29.050
Ensign Reccoa! Why?!

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.780
Fa! Let go!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.400
Miss... Re... ccoa...!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.810
You look well, Fa.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.130
Why did you betray us, Miss Reccoa?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.430
Is that the only way you can look at it?

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:19.970
Of course!

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:22.270
I never was an ideological person.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:28.170
I've been looking for
a way to restore my affections...

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:29.540
...which I lost to war.

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:33.220
Then why is it that you didn't shoot me
down out of pity?!

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.280
Without even becoming emotional!

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:40.450
Right now,
I feel very content as a woman.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.750
I feel stable.

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:45.460
However, I still do remember
the past, from time to time.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.260
You're very selfish!

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:49.990
Your betrayal was a great
shock to me, and to Kamille!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.640
Kamille is suffering from it!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.260
You're right.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:57.330
- Kamille is a man, after all.
- That has nothing to do with it!

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:01.410
Everyone in this world
is either male or female.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:04.850
Ideologies and beliefs are another story.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:09.120
The Argama's men only thought
about themselves.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.520
Are you talking about Lieutenant Quattro?!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:34.200
Miss Reccoa.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:41.780
Miss Reccoa!

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.290
Fa, get in the Methuss!

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:44.320
R-Right!

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:50.190
Enemy!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:51.660
Sarah!

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.360
Why did you appear before me again?!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:55.200
Is that you, Katz?

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.830
Do you want to return to
Scirocco that badly?!

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.270
I do! So don't get in my way!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:10.300
I met Scirocco before I met you!

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.650
That's hardly an excuse!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:15.310
Isn't it?! It's not?! All right, then!

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:18.750
Here, hurry and shoot me!

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.610
Just shoot me down right now!

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.380
Stop it, Sarah!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:25.860
I want to see you!
I want to see and talk with you!

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:28.090
Don't say that.

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:31.600
Even if you do feel that way,
it's unmanly to actually express it in words!

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:34.800
That's why I can't really love
you in my heart!

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:36.640
Sarah...!

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.700
<i>Katz! Shoot her down!</i>

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.540
Why did you have to come, Lieutenant?!

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.520
Katz!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.380
<i>It's all Scirocco's fault!</i>
<i>It's not Sarah's fault!</i>

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:50.350
Katz.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:54.050
I'm so grateful for your kindness,
it brings tears to my eyes.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.750
But you're too late.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.590
Sarah!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.320
You're not getting away!

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:02.770
Sarah!

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:06.600
I can't do it. I can't shoot her down.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.890
Axis will hit the Gate of Zedan!

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.220
No mistake about it!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.730
Don't waste your breath on the obvious!

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:35.460
Lock the course of the Dogosse Gier!

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.330
Come from wherever you wish.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.200
I'll turn anyone approaching into ashes!

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.070
In the direction of the Gate of Zedan?!

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:51.480
Miss Reccoa.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:53.280
So you're seriously fighting us?!

00:15:57.090 --> 00:16:00.180
What's the Zeta Gundam doing here?!

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.420
I'll get you!

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.160
<i>Kamille!</i>

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:12.660
An A.E.U.G. new model?!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.370
I've come from the Jupitris!
I'll back you up!

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:18.500
- I don't need you! Get out of here!
- No, I'll get him!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.700
Hey, wait!

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:22.980
Miss Reccoa!

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:26.070
Kamille, I told you the next time
we meet, we'll fight as enemies!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.680
I'll get you both!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.300
Fa! Get away from it!

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:40.160
Botty! Go and help the Zeta!

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:41.470
Roger!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:47.800
Lieutenant Botty!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.740
You want to get shot down?!

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:52.910
Fa!!

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:56.800
Get out of my way!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.750
Don't do it!!

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:19.370
Lieutenant Apolly!!

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:22.800
Bastard! Bastard!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:23.810
Bastard!

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:25.570
This is war, isn't it?!

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:29.470
Is that the Zeta's power?!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:31.110
Damn you!!

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.050
He cut through it?!

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:04.440
Those flashes leaving Axis
are vessels?!

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:08.510
I can't tell how many!
It's impossible to determine...

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:12.050
...with the Titans' vessels
operating in the foreground!

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:15.190
If we destroy the Titans' vessels,
we'll know the number!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.230
Then hurry and do it!

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:18.990
Haman.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:23.030
She had assembled all the
former Space Forces of the Zabis...

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.090
...and brought them to the Earth Sphere.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:29.170
Axis will hit the Gate of Zedan
in three minutes!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.840
We can't stay here any longer.

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:36.480
All vessels, retreat!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.810
All mobile suits
are to pull out as well!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.150
Sending out retreat signals!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.650
Get all the data on the Axis fleet!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:44.480
That's impossible!

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:46.910
Stop grumbling and do it!

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:55.520
- Retreat orders?!
- Not so easy!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.030
Axis is colliding!

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:02.930
Axis is colliding?!

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:13.810
Proceed forward at top speed!

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:15.750
Or we'll be engulfed
by the aftereffects!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:19.880
It's hitting!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:05.800
Do not fight back!

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:07.740
This ship is now under the control of
the A.E.U.G.!

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:14.910
It's foolish to get crushed
by fragments of the Gate of Zedan!

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:17.880
Y-Your Excellency!

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.250
Never mind me!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.340
Worry about the crew of the Titans' fleet!

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:24.750
The A.E.U.G. is capturing
our transport ships.

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:27.590
They can have them if they wish!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:30.220
We must focus on getting out of
this area!

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:37.700
These'll act as a defensive shield...

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.500
...but they're also blocking my attacks!

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:41.900
I'll close in and finish him off!

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.310
What?!

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:48.170
Kamille! Just leave that
one mobile suit alone!

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:52.070
That golden one!

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:56.540
Are you hurt?

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.450
No. I'm all right.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:01.390
- It's just...!
- Tell me later. We've got to go now!

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:02.590
Y-Yes, sir!

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:17.540
Job well done, Lieutenant Quattro.

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:22.110
Lieutenant Apolly was killed in action.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:23.150
Yes.

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:26.410
He was a truly great pilot.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.250
He was.

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:37.980
I was unable to kill Ensign Reccoa.

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:40.190
Because you're kind, Fa.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:43.460
You wanted to let Reccoa
choose her own path, didn't you?

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.260
That's not it.

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:48.310
I cannot be kind in that way.

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:49.700
I...!

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:55.080
I think she's living the life
of a woman.

00:21:55.150 --> 00:21:57.010
I wouldn't say so.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:06.450
In this way, the Gate of Zedan
was reduced to debris in space.

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:11.920
To force the Titans, who had just lost
their largest base, into a corner...

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:15.400
...Melanie Hue Carbine of the A. E. U.G.
was preparing to enter negotiations...

00:22:15.470 --> 00:22:17.660
...in person with Haman Karn.

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:21.990
The war is about to enter a new phase.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.490 --> 00:23:47.960
A final meeting is held...

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:51.260
...between Scirocco, Haman, and Char.

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:55.190
Kamille heads for the Gwadan
to stop Katz...

00:23:55.270 --> 00:23:57.560
...from taking any foolhardy actions.

00:23:58.270 --> 00:24:02.430
As a result, Katz will witness
Sarah's death.

00:24:03.270 --> 00:24:07.540
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Scirocco Rises".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Scirocco Rises

00:24:08.980 --> 00:24:11.850
You will see the tears of time.
